Organize my prompts as plain JSON, without Markdown fences. Format: the root object has version: 1 and a prompts array. Each prompt has a short title and its complete content (encode line breaks as \n). Optional id is a stable unique string used to update the same prompt on later imports; when omitted, identical titles and content are deduplicated. Optional slot is 1–10, clockwise from the top of the wheel; omit it to add only to the searchable library. Up to 500 prompts per import; titles up to 64 characters; content up to 16384 characters / 64 KiB; complete JSON up to 4 MB. IDs and slots must be unique within an import.
